	('Rest', 'The user falls asleep for the next two turns and restores all of its HP, curing itself of any non-volatile status condition in the process. Fails if the user has full HP, is already asleep, or if another effect is preventing sleep.', 0, 1, 5, 11, 'Status', 1, 10),
