	('Salt Cure', 'Causes damage to the target equal to 1/8 of its maximum HP (1/4 if the target is Steel or Water type), rounded down, at the end of each turn during effect. This effect ends when the target is no longer active.', 40, 100, 15, 13, 'Physical', 1, 10),
